@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - Student Submits Laboratory Work

actor "Student" as Student
participant "Task Requirements" as Task
participant "CLion / Editor" as IDE
participant "Git" as Git
participant "GitHub" as GitHub
participant "Teacher" as Teacher

Student -> Task : read requirements
Student -> IDE : implement work and documentation
Student -> IDE : create UML diagrams
Student -> Git : git add
Student -> Git : git commit
Git --> Student : commit created
Student -> GitHub : git push
GitHub --> Student : repository updated
Student -> Teacher : submit repository link
Teacher -> GitHub : open repository
Teacher -> GitHub : review code, docs, UML images
Teacher --> Student : grade or comments

alt comments received
    Student -> IDE : fix issues
    Student -> Git : commit fixes
    Student -> GitHub : push fixes
    Student -> Teacher : resubmit link
else accepted
    Student <-- Teacher : work accepted
end

@enduml
